@startuml
title UC-03 - Register Resource Definition
autonumber
actor "Platform Engineer" as PE
boundary ResourceDefinitionController as API
control ResourceDefinitionService as Service
entity ResourceDefinition as Validator
control DriverContractInspector as Inspector
control ModuleBundleResolver as Modules
database ResourceTypeRepository as TypeRepo
database ConnectionRepository as ConnectionRepo
database ResourceDefinitionRepository as DefinitionRepo

opt Read capability metadata [BR-23..26, OC-04d]
PE -> API: GET resource-definition-capabilities
API -> API: Authenticate session org and PE/Admin
API -> Service: ListDefinitionCapabilities(ctx, org)
Service -> TypeRepo: ListResourceTypes(org)
TypeRepo --> Service: scoped input schemas
Service -> Inspector: Read verified module metadata
Inspector --> Service: types/defaults/executor-owned contract
Service --> API: safe pairs and variable metadata (no writes)
API --> PE: 200 capabilities
end

opt Discover installed workload bundles [BR-18/19, OC-04b]
PE -> API: GET /api/v1/render-bundles
API -> API: Authenticate session org and PE/Admin
API -> Service: ListRenderBundles()
Service -> Service: Filter immutable registry by registration availability\nSort safe ID/version/AVAILABLE metadata
Service --> API: renderBundles (possibly empty)
API --> PE: 200 safe metadata
end

opt Read-only matching preview [BR-20..22, OC-04c]
PE -> API: POST matching-preview(candidate, explicit context)
API -> API: Authenticate session org and PE/Admin
API -> Service: PreviewMatching(ctx, org, query)
Service -> Service: ReadSnapshot scoped app/env/target/types/definitions\nReplace same-key candidate only in memory
Service -> Service: BestCriterion (five fields only) + winner account validation\nNo registration/inspection/admission/write
Service --> API: incomplete or winner/ties/conflict + snapshot marker
API --> PE: 200 safe snapshot result
end

opt Inspect Git module [GIT-01..06]
PE -> API: POST terraform-modules/inspect(Type, HTTPS URL, path, ref)
API -> API: PE/Admin session + strict bounded body + deadline
API -> Service: InspectTerraformModule(ctx, org, request)
Service -> TypeRepo: Get scoped Type
Service -> Modules: Resolve ref, fetch exact commit, compute digest, inspect/cache
Modules -> DefinitionRepo: Persist verified bundle metadata only
Modules --> Service: immutable verified bundle
Service --> API: capability projection
API --> PE: 200 capability; typed form; technical details collapsed
end

PE -> API: Create or Update Definition(document, expected version) [MS-01..MS-02]
API -> Service: RegisterResourceDefinition(ctx, command)
Service -> Validator: Validate() [MS-03, BR-07]
Validator --> Service: valid
note right of Validator
Missing or [] criteria is rejected.
Explicit {} is wildcard score 0.
end note
Service -> Service: Validate supported existing-cluster/Internal account and workload refs [V03]
Service -> Service: Reject reserved keys and raw credentials; strict Type/driver contract
Service -> TypeRepo: ListResourceTypes(orgID) [MS-04]
TypeRepo --> Service: ResourceType
Service -> Service: Validate scoped READY driverAccount and Driver Inputs region [V02-03]
note right of Service: Symbolic provider registration needs no Environment.
opt Driver requires selected account
Service -> ConnectionRepo: GetConnection(driverAccount) + READY/org/kind check [MS-04]
ConnectionRepo --> Service: Connection
end
Service -> Service: validate Driver Inputs shape/types/placeholders\nand references/provision rules [MS-05, BR-11..BR-14]
alt score-k8s workload Definition
  Service -> Service: Validate installed immutable RenderBundle [BR-15/16]
  Service -> Service: Pin server-owned bundle fingerprint
else infrastructure Definition
  Service -> Modules: Verify prepared Git pin or legacy policy source, immutable content
  Modules --> Service: verified immutable bundle
  Service -> Inspector: Inspect(verified immutable module) [MS-07]
  Inspector --> Service: DriverContract + fingerprint
end
Service -> DefinitionRepo: ListResourceDefinitions(orgID) [MS-06]
DefinitionRepo --> Service: no duplicate ID
Service -> DefinitionRepo: Create or CAS Update Definition + criteria + bundle <<transaction>> [MS-08]
DefinitionRepo --> Service: ResourceDefinition
Service --> API: ResourceDefinition [MS-09]
API --> PE: Registered
note right of DefinitionRepo
Create version1; edit CAS version + 1 atomically.
ID/type immutable; historical snapshots unchanged.
Planning scores five fields without profile filter.
end note

@enduml
